  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">01000386_PPG Enhancing the Climate Resilience of Urban Landscapes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Enhancing the Climate Resilience of Urban Landscapes and Communities in Thimphu-Paro region of Bhutan (ECRUL). As described in the project concept (PIF/child project concept note), this project aims to transform the urban planning, management, governance, and investments of Thimphu and Paro for making them and their population resilient to climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
